"url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T23:28:36Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T23:28:36Z","body":"> For anyone interested: I fixed the problem importing images by changing to 'VRAM Compressed Mode'.\n> \n> <img alt=\"Image\" width=\"775\" height=\"459\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/84047200/570730452-ebf2b13a-a862-43f9-bdcb-9ae1a90866f9.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..37KPISrQUiQHzUmVUkjIbNJOvqH3CAdHLcBJFkJvWxs\">\n> However, at this point I can no longer assume the problem is my graphics card, as I have been playing various games and using professional image editing, processing, and manipulation software, which are very demanding on the graphics card, and no problems are occurring.\n\nPretty strange ... I'm pretty sure I didn't change anything from your repo project in the video... didn't have to change compression mode.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4145909508/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4145925104","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117181#issuecomment-4145925104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117181","id":4145925104,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73Hcvw","user":{"login":"dpnnl","id":84047200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDQ3MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84047200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl","html_url":"https://github.com/dpnnl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpnnl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T23:33:31Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T23:33:31Z","body":"\n> Pretty strange ... I'm pretty sure I didn't change anything from your repo project in the video... didn't have to change compression mode.\n\nFurthermore, I have a problem with lag in the 3D Editor, which another user is also experiencing. We both use Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics. [See here.](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116151#issuecomment-3986842285)\n\nPerhaps the problem is related to the video card specifically.\n\nI mentioned the other case because that might be why you weren't able to reproduce the problem.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4145925104/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4281733028","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117181#issuecomment-4281733028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117181","id":4281733028,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_Ng-k","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T14:35:57Z","updated_at":"2026-04-21T14:41:51Z","body":"I can't reproduce this on 4.7.dev 92846d7c3 (Linux, GeForce RTX 4090 with NVIDIA 580.126.18). I've tested all available compression modes in the MRP and the textures looked correct.\n\nVRAM compression during import runs on the GPU for S3TC and ETC2 when available, so this could in theory be a GPU-specific issue. This is not the case for Basis Universal mode though, which always runs on the CPU.\n\nThat said, for 2D and especially UI art, you should generally use the Lossless compression mode instead (or Lossy if reducing storage size is of utmost priority).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/